<title>USA: Transtech Industries Inc 1996 loss grows.</title>
<headline>Transtech Industries Inc 1996 loss grows.</headline>
<dateline>PISCATAWAY, N.J. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In $000's, except per share data)</p>
<p>						    For the Year</p>
<p>						  Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					     1996		    1995</p>
<p> Revenues				    363		     373</p>
<p> Income (loss) from operations   (2,285)		 (2,929)</p>
<p> Other income (expense)	   (472)(a)		2,066(b)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) from</p>
<p>   continuing operations	   (2,755)		   (417)</p>
<p>Income (loss) from discontinued</p>
<p>   operations				 --		   (351)</p>
