<p>    Extraordinary item		 (.18)			--</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)		 (1.15)		   (.27)</p>
<p>Number of shares used in</p>
<p>   calculation		     2,829,000	     2,829,000</p>
<p>(a) Includes charges of $671,000 and $500,000 in 1996, reflecting reductions in the carrying value of assets held for sale and clay deposits, respectively.  Also includes charge of $37,000 in 1996 related to a reduction in the carrying value of the investment in computer equipment. (b) Includes income of $1,451,000 in 1995 from the reversal of accrued remediation expenses related to a site on which the company operated a solvents-recovery facility. Also includes a charge of $360,000 in 1995 related to a reduction in the carrying value of an investment in computer equipment. (c) Write-off of some intangible assets in conjunction with the sale of Hunt Valve Co Inc.</p>
